# Game_ShuttleRun — Shuttle Run (ID 1)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_ShuttleRun.h, Game_ShuttleRun.cpp
# HTML: data/game_shuttle_setup.html, game_shuttle_names.html, game_shuttle_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Fitness test: 1-6 players alternate between 2 pucks per player for N rounds.
2 pucks per player: start puck + target puck. Race to complete all laps fastest.

## CONFIG
- playerCount (1-6), maxRounds (default 5)
- centralStart: synchronized countdown for all
- holdToStart: all players must hold pucks simultaneously before countdown
- lapMode: false=single finish click, true=multiple laps (double-click to finish)

## STATES
SR_SETUP → SR_WAIT_HANDS → SR_COUNTDOWN (3s, SKI) → SR_RUNNING → SR_FINISHED
Optional: SR_FALSE_START (release during countdown → 2s penalty → restart)

## MECHANICS
- 2 pucks per player, activeTargetIdx toggles between 0/1 on each hit
- 200ms debounce per hit
- False start detection: release during countdown
- Lap mode: double-click within 1s = finish, single click = lap
- Action queue for non-blocking light/sound scheduling
- Flash reset: 150ms visual feedback then restore

## COMMANDS
setup, config_players, config_rounds, cfg_central, cfg_hold, cfg_lap, start_all, stop_all, stop_one, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, time, players: [{round, max, holding, finished, time}], fs (false start player), winnerTime}
